In his <em>Power On</em> newsletter today, <a href="https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-02-22/apple-s-ai-wearables-push-what-to-expect-from-march-4-low-end-macbook-launch"><em>Bloomberg</em>'s Mark Gurman said</a> Apple will have a three-day stretch of product announcements from Monday, March 2 through Wednesday, March 4. In total, he expects Apple to introduce "at least five products."<br/>
<br/>
